  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For a molecule to act as a&nbsp;ligand, it should contain lone pair or negative charge.&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> does not have either a lone pair or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math> -electron pair it cannot act as ligand.</p>"
